      "title": "Checking in",
      "minutes": 4,
      "html": "      <p>Come back every hour or so and open the task&#x27;s thread. Read it top to bottom:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>The checks</strong>, at the top. Are they still the right ones?</li>\n        <li><strong>The reviews.</strong> Is each one specific? &quot;Looks good&quot; is a warning sign.</li>\n        <li><strong>Questions for you.</strong> The PM asks in the thread and waits.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>If it&#x27;s going well, leave it. If something needs a nudge, say so in the thread: both agents read it.</p>"
